Influence_map:Inhibition_map:rule(0):'' A(x{u}[.])->A(x{p}[.]) -> rule(3):'' A(x{u}[.],z{p}[.],w{u}[.])->A(x{u}[.],z{p}[.],w{p}[.])[0->0]
